WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:09.390
Akatambi kano kannyonnyola engeri y’okukozesaamu Arclight okukola fundal ekitangaala ekimyufu ekidda okuva munda mu liiso ng’olonda ensengeka y’ekitangaala esinga okwaka.

2
00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:16.650
Kakasa nti ekifo we bateeka lenzi kiri waggulu, nga tewali maanyi ga lenzi mu kinnya ky’okulaba.

3
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:22.010
Ku buwanvu bw’omukono, weetegereze ekiwujjo mu maaso gombi mu kiseera kye kimu.

4
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.750
Geraageranya okumasamasa ne langi wakati w’amaaso gombi.

5
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:35.290
Mu kukebera okwa bulijjo, tewalina kubaawo njawulo okutwalira awamu mu kumasamasa ne langi wakati w’amaaso gombi.

6
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:42.120
Mu baana abazungu n’aba Asia, reflex esobola okulabika nga ya kijanjalo ne kyenvu.

7
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:50.500
Endabika zino zonna zikyali za bulijjo kuba langi okutwalira awamu n’okumasamasa bye bimu wakati w’amaaso gombi.

8
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:58.980
Ekintu ekitali kya bulijjo (abnormal reflex) bwe wabaawo enjawulo etaggwaawo, eya nnamaddala mu kumasamasa ne langi wakati w’amaaso gombi.

9
00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:10.890
Kino kiyinza okuba ekifaananyi ky’amaaso ekisenguddwa, ekitundu ekiddugavu ekibeera munda mu kifaananyi ky’eriiso erimu oba amaaso gombi, oba ekitangaala ekimyufu ekidda okuva munda mu liiso etaliiwo ddala.

10
00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:25.670
Okukebera okutambula kw’amaaso okutali kwa bulijjo kuyinza okulaga nti waliwo ensobi y’okuzimba amaaso, retinoblastoma, enkovu y’amaaso, okuzimba amaaso oba ensobi mu kuzibikira.

11
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:29.970
Bino byonna byetaaga okwongera okwekenneenya omukugu.
